#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:8
msgid ""
"Checking whether the preferences marking participants as required for AKs "
"can be fulfilled."
msgstr ""
"Prüfe, ob die Präferenzen erfüllt werden können, mit denen Teilnehmende als "
"notwendig für AKs markiert wurden."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:16
msgid ""
"Participants required for more AK slots than there are suitable default "
"slots."
msgstr ""
"Teilnehmende, die für mehr AK-Slots notwendig sind, als es passende "
"Standardslots gibt."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:20
msgid ""
"Since a participant cannot attend multiple slots at the same time, these "
"participants can probably not attend all AKs they are required for, so the "
"automatic scheduling will probably not be able to find a solution."
msgstr ""
"Da niemand an mehreren Slots gleichzeitig teilnehmen kann, können diese "
"Teilnehmenden vermutlich nicht an allen AKs teilnehmen, für die sie "
"notwendig sind. Die automatische Planung wird daher vermutlich keine Lösung "
"finden können."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:25
msgid "Required slots"
msgstr "Notwendige Slots"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:26
msgid "Default slots"
msgstr "Standardslots"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:41
#, python-format
msgid "%(count)s slot"
msgid_plural "%(count)s slots"
msgstr[0] "%(count)s Slot"
msgstr[1] "%(count)s Slots"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:53
msgid ""
"No participant is required for more AK slots than there are suitable default "
"slots."
msgstr ""
"Niemand ist für mehr AK-Slots notwendig, als es passende Standardslots gibt."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:59
msgid ""
"There are no default slots for this event, hence the check whether "
"participants are required for too many AK slots and the strict overlap check "
"were skipped."
msgstr ""
"Für dieses Event gibt es keine Standardslots, daher wurden die Prüfung, ob "
"Teilnehmende für zu viele AK-Slots notwendig sind, und die strenge "
"Überschneidungsprüfung übersprungen."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:67
msgid "Required participants not available for long enough (loose check)"
msgstr "Notwendige Teilnehmende nicht lange genug verfügbar (einfache Prüfung)"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:70
msgid ""
"The availabilities of the AK and of the required participant have to overlap "
"for at least the duration of the longest slot of the AK. Participants "
"without availabilities are considered available during the whole event."
msgstr ""
"Die Verfügbarkeiten des AKs und der notwendigen Person müssen sich "
"mindestens für die Dauer des längsten Slots des AKs überschneiden. "
"Teilnehmende ohne Verfügbarkeiten gelten während des gesamten Events als "
"verfügbar."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:72
msgid "Longest overlap"
msgstr "Längste Überschneidung"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:75
msgid "All required participants are available long enough."
msgstr "Alle notwendigen Teilnehmenden sind lange genug verfügbar."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:85
msgid "Required participants not available for long enough (strict check)"
msgstr "Notwendige Teilnehmende nicht lange genug verfügbar (strenge Prüfung)"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:88
msgid ""
"Only the parts of the overlap that lie within a single default slot intended "
"for the category of the AK are considered. This also includes all violations "
"of the loose check."
msgstr ""
"Es werden nur die Teile der Überschneidung berücksichtigt, die innerhalb "
"eines einzelnen Standardslots für die Kategorie des AKs liegen. Dies umfasst "
"auch alle Verstöße der einfachen Prüfung."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:90
msgid "Longest usable window"
msgstr "Längstes nutzbares Zeitfenster"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/preferences.html:93
msgid ""
"All required participants are available long enough within the default slots "
"of the respective categories."
msgstr ""
"Alle notwendigen Teilnehmenden sind innerhalb der Standardslots der "
"jeweiligen Kategorien lange genug verfügbar."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/requirements.html:8
msgid ""
"Checking for each AK whether there is at least one room that fulfills all of "
"its requirements."
msgstr ""
"Prüfe für jeden AK, ob es mindestens einen Raum gibt, der alle seine "
"Anforderungen erfüllt."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/requirements.html:14
msgid "AKs that have requirements not met by any room"
msgstr "AKs mit Anforderungen, die kein Raum erfüllt"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/requirements.html:19
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(count)s of %(total)s AKs with requirements cannot be placed in any room:"
msgid_plural ""
"%(count)s of %(total)s AKs with requirements cannot be placed in any room:"
msgstr[0] ""
"%(count)s von %(total)s AKs mit Anforderungen kann in keinem Raum platziert "
"werden:"
msgstr[1] ""
"%(count)s von %(total)s AKs mit Anforderungen können in keinem Raum "
"platziert werden:"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/requirements.html:35
msgid ""
"These AKs cannot be scheduled automatically unless their requirements are "
"changed or a room fulfilling all of them is added."
msgstr ""
"Diese AKs können nicht automatisch eingeplant werden, solange ihre "
"Anforderungen nicht geändert werden oder ein Raum hinzugefügt wird, der alle "
"erfüllt."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/requirements.html:38
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The requirements of the %(count)s AK with requirements can be met by at "
"least one room."
msgid_plural ""
"The requirements of all %(count)s AKs with requirements can be met by at "
"least one room."
msgstr[0] ""
"Die Anforderungen des %(count)s AKs mit Anforderungen können von mindestens "
"einem Raum erfüllt werden."
msgstr[1] ""
"Die Anforderungen aller %(count)s AKs mit Anforderungen können von "
"mindestens einem Raum erfüllt werden."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/requirements.html:45
msgid "Edit rooms"
msgstr "Räume bearbeiten"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/results.html:13
#: AKSolverInterface/views.py:45
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Import"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/results.html:18
#, python-format
msgid "%(count)s slot was scheduled by the import."
msgid_plural "%(count)s slots were scheduled by the import."
msgstr[0] "%(count)s Slot wurde durch den Import eingeplant."
msgstr[1] "%(count)s Slots wurden durch den Import eingeplant."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/results.html:25
msgid "Scheduled slots"
msgstr "Geplante Slots"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/results.html:39
msgid "No schedule was imported for this event in this session yet."
msgstr "In dieser Sitzung wurde für dieses Event noch kein Plan importiert."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/results.html:40
msgid "Go to import"
msgstr "Zum Import"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/results.html:48
msgid "Scheduling statistics"
msgstr "Planungsstatistik"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/results.html:53
msgid "Open scheduling statistics"
msgstr "Planungsstatistik öffnen"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/results.html:56
msgid "Scheduling"
msgstr "Scheduling"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/results.html:64
msgid "The schedule was imported successfully."
msgstr "Der Plan wurde erfolgreich importiert."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/slot_ak_list.html:8
msgid "Availabilities"
msgstr "Verfügbarkeiten"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/slot_ak_list.html:18
msgid "End is not after start"
msgstr "Ende liegt nicht nach dem Beginn"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/slot_ak_list.html:18
msgid "invalid"
msgstr "ungültig"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/slot_ak_list.html:18
msgid "None"
msgstr "Keine"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/slots.html:8
msgid ""
"Checking for each AK whether its availability overlaps with a default slot "
"for at least the duration of its longest slot."
msgstr ""
"Prüfe für jeden AK, ob sich seine Verfügbarkeit mindestens für die Dauer "
"seines längsten Slots mit einem Standardslot überschneidet."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/slots.html:13
msgid ""
"There are no default slots for this event, hence this check was skipped. AKs "
"could be scheduled at any time between start and end of the event (including "
"nights)."
msgstr ""
"Für dieses Event gibt es keine Standardslots, daher wurde diese Prüfung "
"übersprungen. AKs könnten zu jeder Zeit zwischen Beginn und Ende des Events "
"eingeplant werden (inklusive Nächte)."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/slots.html:14
#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/slots.html:51
#: AKSolverInterface/views.py:343
msgid "Edit Default Slots"
msgstr "Standardslots bearbeiten"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/slots.html:19
msgid "All AKs fit into at least one default slot of their category."
msgstr "Alle AKs passen in mindestens einen Standardslot ihrer Kategorie."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/slots.html:27
msgid "AKs that cannot be placed in any default slot"
msgstr "AKs, die in keinem Standardslot platziert werden können"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/slots.html:30
msgid ""
"The availability of these AKs does not overlap long enough with any default "
"slot (regardless of its categories). They cannot be scheduled automatically."
msgstr ""
"Die Verfügbarkeit dieser AKs überschneidet sich mit keinem Standardslot "
"lange genug (unabhängig von dessen Kategorien). Sie können nicht automatisch "
"eingeplant werden."

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/slots.html:40
msgid "AKs that only fit into default slots of other categories"
msgstr "AKs, die nur in Standardslots anderer Kategorien passen"

#: AKSolverInterface/templates/admin/AKSolverInterface/scheduling_wizard/slots.html:43
msgid ""
"These AKs can only be placed in default slots that are not intended for "
"their category. Change the availabilities, the categories of the default "
"slots, or ignore the category for these AKs when exporting."
msgstr ""
"Diese AKs können nur in Standardslots platziert werden, die nicht für ihre "
"Kategorie vorgesehen sind. Ändere die Verfügbarkeiten oder die Kategorien "
"der Standardslots, oder ignoriere die Kategorie dieser AKs beim Export."

#: AKSolverInterface/views.py:37
msgid "Automatic Scheduling Workflow"
msgstr "Workflow: Automatische Planerstellung"

#: AKSolverInterface/views.py:39
msgid "Basic Checks"
